Description: Bianbu AgentOS security daemon
 Security policy, D-Bus authorization, audit, DLP, sandbox and
 code-signing services for the Bianbu AgentOS runtime.
 .
 This development/demo delivery disables Agent code-package signature
 verification by default. The implementation remains available for product
 releases. The bundled WebUI also runs without Bearer-token authentication
 in demo mode; product releases retain and enforce the authentication code.
